I... forgot

405
00:48:34.577 --> 00:48:35.566
Guilty?

406
00:48:36.746 --> 00:48:37.735
As in I am guilty?

407
00:48:40.116 --> 00:48:42.812
Look it up in jail; you'll have time

408
00:48:43.185 --> 00:48:44.550
