490
00:53:53.229 --> 00:53:54.389
You're my wife!

491
00:53:55.164 --> 00:53:58.156
If I can't handle you,
how can I handle the police?

492
00:53:58.934 --> 00:54:01.698
What are you, just trash!

493
00:54:02.004 --> 00:54:03.130
You're just a cop

494
