507
00:54:45.047 --> 00:54:50.007
Look at yourself, you're not like me at all!

508
00:54:53.122 --> 00:54:54.111
Trash!

509
00:54:58.227 --> 00:55:00.252
Joe, don't mind him

510
00:55:00.629 --> 00:55:03.359
