538
00:57:51.733 --> 00:57:52.722
Sam Wong

539
00:57:52.935 --> 00:57:54.698
Who is Sam Wong?

540
00:57:55.003 --> 00:57:56.095
One of your bosses

541
00:57:56.538 --> 00:57:58.369
He used to be a cop

542
00:58:02.411 --> 00:58:03.878
Sam Wong?

543
00:58:04.179 --> 00:58:05.305
Don't know him; beat it!

544
